# Build context of api/Dockerfile. Allowlist: never let a developer's appsettings.json or .env into an image.
*
!global.json
!api/
api/**/bin/
api/**/obj/
api/**/TestResults/
api/.vs/
api/Elmanhg.Tests/
api/**/.env
